#. module: hr_attendance_time_credit
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_attendance_time_credit.field_hr_attendance__total_credited_hours
msgid ""
"Worked hours plus all credited minutes converted to hours. Time credits "
"represent supplementary credits (travel time, dressing time, paid breaks, "
"weekend premiums, etc.) that are distinct from worked time; this field "
"combines both for reporting and payroll reference."
msgstr ""
"Horas trabajadas más todos los minutos acreditados convertidos a horas. Los "
"tiempos acreditados representan créditos complementarios (desplazamiento, "
"vestuario, pausas retribuidas, plus de fin de semana, etc.) distintos del "
"tiempo trabajado; este campo combina ambos para informes y referencia de "
"nómina."

#. module: hr_attendance_time_credit
